          <h2>Fujiiryoki — Japanese heritage &amp; AI.</h2>
          <p>Fujiiryoki is one of the original Japanese massage chair makers. The brand pioneered AI-programmed massage and refined Japanese precision over decades.</p>
          <p>The Fujiiryoki lineup includes <a href="{{ shop.url }}/products/fujiiryoki-cyber-relax-ai-massage-chair">Cyber Relax AI</a>, <a href="{{ shop.url }}/products/fujiiryoki-cyber-relax-elite-massage-chair">Cyber Relax Elite</a>, the dual <a href="{{ shop.url }}/products/fujiiryoki-cyber-relax-pro-massage-chair">Cyber Relax Pro 4D Dual</a>, and the traditional <a href="{{ shop.url }}/products/mr-6000-calm-plus-fujiiryoki-massage-chair">MR-6000 Calm Plus</a>.</p>
