            <li>Authentic Japanese heritage and engineering.</li>
            <li>AI-programmed massage on premium models.</li>
            <li>Refined Japanese precision in build.</li>
            <li>Multiple price tiers from traditional to flagship.</li>
            <li>Best fit when Japanese authenticity matters.</li>
