          <p>The two flagship comparisons are <a href="{{ shop.url }}/products/jp-medics-kaze-duo-massage-chair">KaZe Duo</a> for advanced dual-engine massage and <a href="{{ shop.url }}/products/kozue-massage-chair-jp-medics">Kozue</a> for the elevated craftsmanship benchmark.</p>
